ct\">Book a Discovery Call</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md font-medium focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ssl-blue focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-white disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 border transition-colors h-11 px-8 text-base glass-chip border-white/20 text-white hover:bg-white/15\" href=\"/services\">Explore Services</a></div><ul class=\"mx-auto mt-12 flex max-w-3xl flex-wrap justify-center gap-3\"><li class=\"glass-chip rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-200\">Websites &amp; web apps</li><li class=\"glass-chip rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-200\">Search &amp; AI visibility</li><li class=\"glass-chip rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-200\">Data &amp; sales systems</li></ul></div></section><section class=\"relative z-10 -mt-24 px-4 sm:px-6\" id=\"metrics\"><div class=\"glass-card-dark mx-auto max-w-6xl rounded-3xl px-6 py-8 md:px-12 md:py-10\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 text-center md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"p-4\"><div class=\"mb-1 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-300\">We don&#x27;t report on</div><div class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-300 line-through decoration-red-400/70\">Clicks and impressions</div></div><div class=\"hidden items-center justify-center p-4 md:flex\"><div class=\"h-8 w-px bg-ssl-gold/25\"></div></div><div class=\"p-4\"><div class=\"mb-1 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-ssl-gold\">We report on</div><div class=\"text-xl font-black tracking-tight text-white sm:text-2xl\">Leads, sales and revenue</div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mesh-light relative isolate px-4 pb-20 pt-24 sm:px-6 md:pb-28 md:pt-28\" id=\"capabilities\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute -left-32 top-[8%] h-[28rem] w-[28rem] rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle,rgba(26,89,204,0.32),transparent_65%)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute -right-24 top-[38%] h-[30rem] w-[30rem] rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle,rgba(197,160,89,0.38),transparent_65%)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-[-6rem] left-[30%] h-[24rem] w-[24rem] rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle,rgba(56,189,248,0.22),transparent_65%)]\"></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><div class=\"reveal reveal-slide-up\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center items-center mb-14 md:text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-ssl-gold-deep\">WHAT WE DO</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl text-ssl-bg\">Services</h2><p class=\"text-base text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Seven services that work on their own or together, from your website to your sales pipeline.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 items-stretch gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl overflow-hidden glass-card-light glass-edge glass-hover reveal reveal-slide-up group h-full lg:col-span-2\"><a class=\"flex h-full flex-col p-7 md:p-8\" href=\"/services/technical-infrastructure-web-dev\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-x-8 top-0 h-[2px] origin-left scale-x-0 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-ssl-gold via-ssl-gold to-ssl-blue transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-x-100\"></span><div class=\"flex flex-col w-full items-start mb-7 h-auto justify-start gap-4\"><div class=\"p-2.5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center border transition-colors duration-300 border-white/40 bg-gradient-to-br from-ssl-blue to-[#0d3a8c] text-white shadow-lg shadow-ssl-blue/25 group-hover:from-ssl-gold group-hover:to-[#9A7432] group-hover:shadow-ssl-gold/30\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cpu h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M12 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M17 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M17 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M7 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M7 2v2\"></path><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg></span></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-tight transition-colors duration-300 text-ssl-bg group-hover:text-ssl-blue\">Websites &amp; Web Apps</h3><p class=\"text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">We build fast, serverless websites and web apps (Next.js, Tailwind) that load quickly on African mobile networks, with Paystack, Flutterwave and CRM integrations.</p></div><span class=\"mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-ssl-blue\">Learn more<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl overflow-hidden glass-card-light glass-edge glass-hover reveal reveal-slide-up group h-full\"><a class=\"flex h-full flex-col p-7 md:p-8\" href=\"/services/algorithmic-search\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-x-8 top-0 h-[2px] origin-left scale-x-0 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-ssl-gold via-ssl-gold to-ssl-blue transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-x-100\"></span><div class=\"flex flex-col w-full items-start mb-7 h-auto justify-start gap-4\"><div class=\"p-2.5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center border transition-colors duration-300 border-white/40 bg-gradient-to-br from-ssl-blue to-[#0d3a8c] text-white shadow-lg shadow-ssl-blue/25 group-hover:from-ssl-gold group-hover:to-[#9A7432] group-hover:shadow-ssl-gold/30\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-atom h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"></circle><path d=\"M20.2 20.2c2.04-2.03.02-7.36-4.5-11.9-4.54-4.52-9.87-6.54-11.9-4.5-2.04 2.03-.02 7.36 4.5 11.9 4.54 4.52 9.87 6.54 11.9 4.5Z\"></path><path d=\"M15.7 15.7c4.52-4.54 6.54-9.87 4.5-11.9-2.03-2.04-7.36-.02-11.9 4.5-4.52 4.54-6.54 9.87-4.5 11.9 2.03 2.04 7.36.02 11.9-4.5Z\"></path></svg></span></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-tight transition-colors duration-300 text-ssl-bg group-hover:text-ssl-blue\">Search &amp; AI Visibility (SEO/AEO/GEO)</h3><p class=\"text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">Technical SEO plus answer and generative engine optimization (AEO/GEO), so your business ranks in search and gets cited by AI tools like ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity.</p></div><span class=\"mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-ssl-blue\">Learn more<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl overflow-hidden glass-card-light glass-edge glass-hover reveal reveal-slide-up group h-full\"><a class=\"flex h-full flex-col p-7 md:p-8\" href=\"/services/data-systems-automation\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-x-8 top-0 h-[2px] origin-left scale-x-0 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-ssl-gold via-ssl-gold to-ssl-blue transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-x-100\"></span><div class=\"flex flex-col w-full items-start mb-7 h-auto justify-start gap-4\"><div class=\"p-2.5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center border transition-colors duration-300 border-white/40 bg-gradient-to-br from-ssl-blue to-[#0d3a8c] text-white shadow-lg shadow-ssl-blue/25 group-hover:from-ssl-gold group-hover:to-[#9A7432] group-hover:shadow-ssl-gold/30\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-no-axes-column-increasing lucide-bar-chart h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 21v-6\"></path><path d=\"M12 21V9\"></path><path d=\"M19 21V3\"></path></svg></span></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-tight transition-colors duration-300 text-ssl-bg group-hover:text-ssl-blue\">Data Systems &amp; Automation</h3><p class=\"text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">We design data architecture, APIs and automated pipelines that connect your internal tools, so your team stops moving data by hand.</p></div><span class=\"mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-ssl-blue\">Learn more<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl overflow-hidden glass-card-light glass-edge glass-hover reveal reveal-slide-up group h-full\"><a class=\"flex h-full flex-col p-7 md:p-8\" href=\"/services/revenue-operations-revops\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-x-8 top-0 h-[2px] origin-left scale-x-0 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-ssl-gold via-ssl-gold to-ssl-blue transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-x-100\"></span><div class=\"flex flex-col w-full items-start mb-7 h-auto justify-start gap-4\"><div class=\"p-2.5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center border transition-colors duration-300 border-white/40 bg-gradient-to-br from-ssl-blue to-[#0d3a8c] text-white shadow-lg shadow-ssl-blue/25 group-hover:from-ssl-gold group-hover:to-[#9A7432] group-hover:shadow-ssl-gold/30\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-dollar-sign h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"2\" y2=\"22\"></line><path d=\"M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6\"></path></svg></span></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-tight transition-colors duration-300 text-ssl-bg group-hover:text-ssl-blue\">Revenue Operations (RevOps)</h3><p class=\"text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">CRM setup in HubSpot, Zoho or Salesforce, multi-touch attribution dashboards and lead scoring that remove friction from your sales funnel.</p></div><span class=\"mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-ssl-blue\">Learn more<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl overflow-hidden glass-card-light glass-edge glass-hover reveal reveal-slide-u