en=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl overflow-hidden glass-card-light glass-edge glass-hover reveal reveal-slide-up group h-full\"><a class=\"flex h-full flex-col p-7 md:p-8\" href=\"/services/corporate-pr-brand-authority\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-x-8 top-0 h-[2px] origin-left scale-x-0 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-ssl-gold via-ssl-gold to-ssl-blue transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-x-100\"></span><div class=\"flex flex-col w-full items-start mb-7 h-auto justify-start gap-4\"><div class=\"p-2.5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center border transition-colors duration-300 border-white/40 bg-gradient-to-br from-ssl-blue to-[#0d3a8c] text-white shadow-lg shadow-ssl-blue/25 group-hover:from-ssl-gold group-hover:to-[#9A7432] group-hover:shadow-ssl-gold/30\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-gem h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.5 3 8 9l4 13 4-13-2.5-6\"></path><path d=\"M17 3a2 2 0 0 1 1.6.8l3 4a2 2 0 0 1 .013 2.382l-7.99 10.986a2 2 0 0 1-3.247 0l-7.99-10.986A2 2 0 0 1 2.4 7.8l2.998-3.997A2 2 0 0 1 7 3z\"></path><path d=\"M2 9h20\"></path></svg></span></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-tight transition-colors duration-300 text-ssl-bg group-hover:text-ssl-blue\">PR &amp; Reputation</h3><p class=\"text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">Media relations, crisis planning and clear brand positioning that build long-term authority for your company.</p></div><span class=\"mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-ssl-blue\">Learn more<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl overflow-hidden glass-card-light glass-edge glass-hover reveal reveal-slide-up group h-full order-last lg:col-span-2\"><a class=\"flex h-full flex-col p-7 md:p-8\" href=\"/services/marketing-sales-capacity-building\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-x-8 top-0 h-[2px] origin-left scale-x-0 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-ssl-gold via-ssl-gold to-ssl-blue transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-x-100\"></span><div class=\"flex flex-col w-full items-start mb-7 h-auto justify-start gap-4\"><div class=\"p-2.5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center border transition-colors duration-300 border-white/40 bg-gradient-to-br from-ssl-blue to-[#0d3a8c] text-white shadow-lg shadow-ssl-blue/25 group-hover:from-ssl-gold group-hover:to-[#9A7432] group-hover:shadow-ssl-gold/30\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></span></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-tight transition-colors duration-300 text-ssl-bg group-hover:text-ssl-blue\">Marketing &amp; Sales Team Training</h3><p class=\"text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">We train your in-house marketing and sales teams with modern playbooks, tools and workflows, so the skills stay in your business.</p></div><span class=\"mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-ssl-blue\">Learn more<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-ssl-bg px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 md:py-28\" id=\"why-ssl\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"-z-20 object-cover opacity-70\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/blur-blue-amber-1200.webp\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-b from-ssl-bg/80 via-ssl-bg/60 to-ssl-bg/85\"></div><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><div class=\"reveal reveal-slide-up\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center items-center mb-14 md:text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-500\">WHY WORK WITH US</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl text-white\">Marketing and Engineering in One Team</h2><p class=\"text-base text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">The people who plan your strategy also build it, so nothing gets lost between agencies.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl overflow-hidden glass-card-dark reveal reveal-slide-up group h-full p-7\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 w-full items-start h-auto justify-start\"><div class=\"p-2.5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center border transition-colors duration-300 bg-ssl-gold/10 border-ssl-gold/25 text-ssl-gold\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-no-axes-column lucide-bar-chart-2 h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 21v-6\"></path><path d=\"M12 21V3\"></path><path d=\"M19 21V9\"></path></svg></span></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-tight transition-colors duration-300 text-white\">Results You Can Measure</h3><p class=\"text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-slate-300\">We report on leads, sales and revenue, not clicks and impressions.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl overflow-hidden glass-card-dark reveal reveal-slide-up group h-full p-7\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 w-full items-start h-auto justify-start\"><div class=\"p-2.5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center border transition-colors duration-300 bg-ssl-gold/10 border-ssl-gold/25 text-ssl-gold\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 18 6-6-6-6\"></path><path d=\"m8 6-6 6 6 6\"></path></svg></span></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-tight transition-colors duration-300 text-white\">Real Technical Skill</h3><p class=\"text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-slate-300\">Our marketing is backed by solid engineering: fast websites, clean data and systems that keep working as you grow.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl overflow-hidden glass-card-dark reveal reveal-slide-up group h-full p-7\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 w-full items-start h-auto justify-start\"><div class=\"p-2.5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center border transition-colors duration-300 bg-ssl-gold/10 border-ssl-gold/25 text-ssl-gold\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers lucide-layers-3 h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\"></path><path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\"></path></svg></span></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-tight transition-colors duration-300 text-white\">One Team, Start to Finish</h3><p class=\"text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-slate-300\">The same team plans the work and builds it. No handoffs between agencies, and nothing lost along the way.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mesh-light px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 md:py-28\" id=\"process\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><div class=\"reveal reveal-slide-up\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center items-center mb-14 md:mb-16\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-ssl-gold-deep\">HOW WE WORK</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl text-ssl-bg\">How a Project Runs</h2><p class=\"text-base text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Four steps, from finding the problem to improving the results.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute left-[12%] right-[12%] top-12 hidden h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-ssl-gold/40 to-transparent lg:block\"></div><ol class=\"relative grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-8\"><li class=\"reveal reveal-slide-up glass-card-light glass-edge glass-hover relative flex h-full flex-col items-start rounded-2xl p-7\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mb-5 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-ssl-blue to-[#0d3a8c] font-display text-lg font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-ssl-blue/25\">01</div><h3 class=\"mb-3 font-display text-xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\">Audit</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">We review your website, marketing and data to find what is holding growth back. We go on evidence, not guesswork.</p></li><li class=\"reveal reveal-slide-up glass-card-light glass-edge glass-hover relative flex h-full flex-col items-start rounded-2xl p-7\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mb-5 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-ssl-blue to-[#0d3a8c] font-display text-lg font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-ssl-blue/25\">02</div><h3 class=\"mb-3 font-display text-xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\">Plan</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">We plan the fix as one connected piece of work covering your website, automation and marketing, instead of separate patches.</p></li><li class=\"reveal reveal-slide-up glass-card-light glass-edge glass-hover relative flex h-full flex-col items-start rounded-2xl p-7\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mb-5 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-ssl-blue to-[#0d3a8c] font-display text-lg font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-ssl-blue/25\">03</div><h3 class=\"mb-3 font-display text-xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\">Build</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">We build and launch in short, focused stages, with clear updates along the way.</p></li><li class=\"reveal reveal-slide-up glass-card-light glass-edge glass-hover relative flex h-full flex-col items-start rounded-2xl p-7\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mb-5 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-ssl-blue to-[#0d3a8c] font-display text-lg font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-ssl-blue/25\">04</div><h3 class=\"mb-3 font-display text-xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\">Improve</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">After launch we track leads and revenue and keep improving what works.</p></li></ol></div></div></section><section class=\"mesh-light px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 md:py-24\"><div class=\"reveal reveal-scale\"><div class=\"relative isolate mx-auto max-w-5xl overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-ssl-bg shadow-2xl shadow-ssl-bg/30\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"-z-20 object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/blur-blue-amber-1200.webp\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-ssl-bg/40\"></div><div class=\"glass-card-dark m-3 rounded-[1.6rem] px-6 py-14 text-center sm:m-4 md:px-16 md:py-20\"><h2 class=\"mb-5 text-fluid-h2 font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white\">Ready to Talk About Your Project?</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mb-10 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-300 md:text-xl\">Tell us what you want to improve and we will suggest where to start.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ssl-blue focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-white disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 bg-[#C5A059] text-[#01081b] hover:bg-[#b08e4d] font-medium transition-colors h-11 px-10 text-base shadow-lg shadow-ssl-gold/25\" href=\"#contact\">Start a Project</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mesh-light relative isolate px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 md:py-28\" id=\"contact\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute -left-32 top-[8%] h-[28rem] w-[28rem] rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle,rgba(26,89,204,0.32),transparent_65%)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute -right-24 top-[38%] h-[30rem] w-[30rem] rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle,rgba(197,160,89,0.38),transparent_65%)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-[-6rem] left-[30%] h-[24rem] w-[24rem] rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle,rgba(56,189,248,0.22),transparent_65%)]\"></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-5xl grid-cols-1 items-start gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-12\"><div><div><h2 class=\"mb-6 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ssl-bg md:text-4xl\">Get in Touch</h2><p class=\"mb-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">Tell us what you are working on and we will get back to you shortly.</p><div class=\"glass-card-light glass-edge space-y-5 rounded-2xl p-7 text-sm text-slate-700\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"font-bold text-ssl-bg w-20\">Address:</span><span>Thome, Nairobi - Kenya</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"font-bold text-ssl-bg w-20\">Phone:</span><a href=\"tel:+254712895903\" class=\"hover:text-ssl-blue transition-colors\">+254 712 895 903</a></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"font-bold text-ssl-bg w-20\">Email:</span><a href=\"mailto:connect@signalstraitlabs.com\" class=\"hover:text-ssl-blue transition-colors\">connect@signalstraitlabs.com</a></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"font-bold text-ssl-bg w-20\">Social:</span><a href=\"https://linkedin.com/company/signal-strait-labs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:text-ssl-blue transition-colors\">LinkedIn<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"h-4 w-4 fill-current\"><path d=\"M19 0h-14c-2.761 0-5 2.239-5 5v14c0 2.761 2.239 5 5 5h14c2.762 0 5-2.239 5-5v-14c0-2.761-2.238-5-5-5zm-11 19h-3v-11h3v11zm-1.5-12.268c-.966 0-1.75-.79-1.75-1.764s.784-1.764 1.75-1.764 1.75.79 1.75 1.764-.783 1.764-1.75 1.764zm13.5 12.268h-3v-5.604c0-3.368-4-3.113-4 0v5.604h-3v-11h3v1.765c1.396-2.586 7-2.777 7 2.476v6.759z\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"reveal reveal-scale glass-card-dark relative z-10 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-9\"><h3 class=\"mb-6 text-lg font-bold text-white\">Send Us a Message</h3><form class=\"space-y-5\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"hidden\" t