building\">Marketing &amp; Sales Team Training</option></select><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute right-4 top-1/2 h-4 w-4 -translate-y-1/2 text-slate-300\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg></div></div><div><label for=\"_R_mludb_-budget\" class=\"mb-2 block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400\">Budget range</label><div class=\"relative\"><select id=\"_R_mludb_-budget\" name=\"budgetRange\" class=\"glass-input-dark w-full appearance-none rounded-lg px-4 py-3 pr-10 text-sm\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Select a range</option><option value=\"Under $2,000\">Under $2,000</option><option value=\"$2,000 - $5,000\">$2,000 - $5,000</option><option value=\"$5,000 - $15,000\">$5,000 - $15,000</option><option value=\"$15,000+\">$15,000+</option><option value=\"Not sure yet\">Not sure yet</option></select><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute right-4 top-1/2 h-4 w-4 -translate-y-1/2 text-slate-300\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg></div></div><div><label for=\"_R_mludb_-message\" class=\"mb-2 block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400\">Message</label><textarea rows=\"3\" class=\"glass-input-dark w-full resize-none rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-sm\" id=\"_R_mludb_-message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"Tell us what you need\" required=\"\"></textarea></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg border border-ssl-gold/30 bg-ssl-blue py-3.5 text-sm font-bold tracking-wide text-white shadow-lg shadow-ssl-blue/20 transition-all hover:border-ssl-gold/50 hover:bg-ssl-blue/90 disabled:opacity-50\">Send Message</button></form></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"mesh-dark rela